Subject: [PATCH 1/9] fix: preserve TOMORI customizations on Ingressi v2.10.0

From: Codex <codex@localhost>

Adapt the existing customization series to the asynchronous database facade,
scoped permissions, updated dashboard and Caddy configuration generator.
Retain OAuth role synchronization, Authentik transport handling, Anubis
controls, branded error pages, request attribution and forward-auth binding.

Keep the existing encrypted certificate format and security dependency
floor. Add an isolated database rehearsal tool to verify migrations,
certificate key decryption and generated Caddy configuration.

Validation:
- TypeScript and custom runtime tests passed.
- Both production database copies migrated with unchanged entity counts.
- Imported certificate keys matched, including Cloudflare Origin CA.
- Both generated configurations passed Caddy 2.11.7 validation.
- Full upstream suite is being verified before deployment.
